{"id":"619606","name":"网红菜卷心菜牛排","author":"海蓝澜","authorId":"17338","desc":"","cover":"images/619606/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"卷心菜","amount":"1/4个"},{"name":"火腿片","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"奶酪片","amount":"1个"},{"name":"奶酪碎","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备所需食材；","img":"images/619606/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅内融化少许黄油；","img":"images/619606/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入卷心菜，两面撒盐和黑胡椒，小火煎上色；","img":"images/619606/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放一片奶酪和奶酪碎；","img":"images/619606/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加盖，小火焖至奶酪融化；","img":"images/619606/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"底油炒香火腿和蒜末；","img":"images/619606/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"火腿放在卷心菜上即可。","img":"images/619606/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"卷心菜四周用牙签固定，煎时不易松散。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}